Checco"},{"id":134848,"name":"Sext"},{"id":236697,"name":"L.M."},{"id":287705,"name":"Digital Bits"},{"id":395539,"name":"Francesco Bontempi"},{"id":2178319,"name":"Fish And C.o."}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["D.J. Lee Marrow","L. Marrow","L.Marrow","Le Marrown","Lee Harrow","Lee Marlow","Lee Marow","Lee Marro","Lee Marrow 93","Lee Marroww","Ли Мароу"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/14490-Lee-Marrow","type":"artist","urls":["https://web.archive.org/web/20170625095417/http://www.womrecords.it/bontempi.htm","https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Marrow"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/151223/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"151223","image":"https://i.discogs.com/Ea_EHEQgQCnQgPqVDuz589TncOipC5jGEl8BBCIBkK8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE1MTIy/My0xNzYxNjA1NTU3/LTk0ODMuanBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/EPrJT_fXlqXTQu0ziHJjPr7OkaIM7_pZ6Naeo_EQgGM/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE1MTIy/My0xNzYxNjA1NTU3/LTk0ODMuanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"British R&B / soul and jazz singer / songwriter and artist.\r\n\r\nBorn: 14 September 1983 in London, England, UK.\r\nDied: 23 July 2011 in London, England, UK (aged 27).\r\n\r\nHer debut album, \"[m=51290]\" (2003) was nominated for the Mercury Music Prize, and she won an Ivor Novello award in 2004 for her debut single \"[m=51301]\" (2003). Her second album \"[m=51256]\" (2006) was one the highest-selling for that year.\r\nDuring 2009 up until 2011, Amy focused on touring, writing lyrics, and attending events with her boyfriend Richard Traviss. From December 2010 to June of 2011, Amy Winehouse toured until her Serbian Performance on June 18th, 2011.\r\n\r\nOn July 23rd, 2011, Amy Winehouse would end up with alcohol poisoning and died at the age of 27 at her home in Camden, London, UK.\r\nAmy Winehouse's label, Island Records would release posthumous work such as \"Lioness: Hidden Treasures\" on December 2nd, 2011.\r\n\r\nFounder of [l=Lioness Records].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:151223","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["A. Winehouse","A.Winehouse","Amy","Amy Jade Winehouse","Amy W.","Amy Whinehouse","Amy Whitehouse","Amy Wynehouse","E. Winehouse","Winehouse","エイミー・ワインハウス","艾美懷絲"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/151223-Amy-Winehouse","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.amywinehouse.com/","https://amywinehousefoundation.org/","https://www.facebook.com/amywinehouse/","https://www.facebook.com/amywinehousefoundation/","https://www.instagram.com/amywinehouse/","https://x.com/amywinehouse/","https://myspace.com/amywinehouse","https://www.youtube.com/@amywinehousevideo","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Winehouse"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/16360/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"16360","image":"https://i.discogs.com/bDpwmtoRBvBJ5lv7e4-BGmNtuPCJ7O5SBR3kQfKDTFs/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:585/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2MzYw/LTE3NzYzMjQ2OTQt/ODIxMS5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/zEAYf8aG7CpFPbdzVIeQkjwUBaVX1pDs5w-bdvmwB1E/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2MzYw/LTE3NzYzMjQ2OTQt/ODIxMS5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"Grammy-award winning R&B and hip-hop soul singer. Quasi-cousin of R&B singers [a=Toni Braxton] and [a=Trina Braxton], rapper [a=Xzibit] and nephew of movie actress [a=Mo'Nique].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:16360","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":327649,"name":"Mario Barrett"},{"id":1875740,"name":"Günter Witteborn"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["馬利歐"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/16360-Mario","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.marioworldwide.com","http://www.facebook.com/mario","http://www.instagram.com/marioworldwide","http://www.instagram.com/mario_barrett","http://twitter.com/ohyesmario","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mario_(Amer